  "title": "FB Bancorp, Inc. Authorizes Second Stock Repurchase Program",
  "summary": "New Orleans, LA; February 9, 2026 – FB Bancorp, Inc. (the “Company”) (Nasdaq: FBLA), the holding company for Fidelity Bank, announced today it has authorized a second stock repurchase program for up to 1,785,375 shares of its common stock, representing 10% of shares currently outstanding. Previously, the Company completed its first stock repurchase program on November 13, 2025, whereby 1,983,750 shares of the Company’s common stock were repurchased. The initial repurchase was completed on Januar",
